Waste and by-product management in hot rolling mills

Apart from waste water, hot rolling operations generate different kinds of solid and liquid by-products and waste:

metallic waste and by-products;
scarfing scale/swarf;
dusts from scarfing and rolling;
mill scale (oil-free and oily);
water treatment and mill scale sludge;
grinding sludge (roll shop);
oil and greases.

