General

Generic steps in the manufacture of feed for fur animals are as follows:

reception and storage of raw materials;
processing of materials into the final product;
storage and dispatch of the final product;
cleaning activities.

The equipment common to this sector includes:

silos, freezing and cooling equipment, tanks;
crusher, chopper;
weighing system;
mixer;
homogeniser;
conveyor belts for transportation of material;
tanker trucks for delivery to the customers;
emission abatement syste

