Description
Textiles that do not require finishing with flame retardants are used. If not possible, flame retardants are selected considering:

the risks associated with the substances (see Section 4.1.6.1) in particular in terms of persistence and toxicity, including the potential for substitution (e.g. brominated flame retardants (see Section 4.1.6.1));
