Water management plan and water audits

Description
A water management plan and water audits are part of the environmental management system (Environmental Management System (EMS)) and include:

flow diagrams and a water mass balances of the plant and processes;
establishment of water efficiency objectives;
implementation of water optimisation techniques (e.g. control of water usage, reuse/recycling, detection and repair of leaks);

