The principles described in Section 4.5.1.7 are applied to winch beck machines:

indirect heating and cooling;
improved liquor/goods contact;
low and constant liquor ratio;
extraction of the liquor from the goods by vacuum and reuse of the extracted liquor;
enclosure with hoods;
