LVOC:::2.4.11.2.content:
Unplanned other than normal operating conditions

Unplanned events include:

malfunction of process utilities (e.g. loss of electricity, water, vacuum);
malfunction of process equipment (e.g. leakages);
malfunction of abatement plant;
operator error and accidents.

